data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Everything checks out:\n- DS components render `data-component` attributes (AppShell, Header, Footer, Button)\n- Server listening on 0.0.0.0:5173\n- Build passes, tokens used, no hex in app code, layout CSS uses DS spacing/font tokens\n\nThe developer's work matches the design. Accept the developer, record nothing major. One consideration: README's `npm run serve` = `vite preview` binds localhost:4173 by default (not 0.0.0.0:5173). The mission's serving requirement is met by my dev server. qa will run the documented commands in its own machine; localhost is fine for its verification. I'll note this in the qa dispatch so qa knows to look on the port its serve command actually prints, and that the delivered interface is the dev server on 5173. Actually, qa reads README and runs commands; vite preview prints its URL. qa is capable. I'll mention it briefly in the qa dispatch to prevent confusion.\n\nAccept developer, push merged HEAD to qa, dispatch qa."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793343319,"id":"chatcmpl-6ea197fb","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

